      "id": 1,
      "text": "Mount Vernon was officially established in 1793 as the county seat of Montgomery County, securing its role as a regional administrative center early in Georgia’s history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
