      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Brewton–Parker College, a private liberal arts institution, calls Mount Vernon home, adding a college‑town vibe to the historic downtown.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
